---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../components/SectionHeading.astro';
import { featuredLive } from '../data/lives';
---

<BaseLayout title="Lives" description="Lives e rodadas do Boteco RWX.">
  <section class="page-hero section-pad">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">ARQUIVO DO BOTECO</span>
      <h1>Lives</h1>
      <p>Cada rodada ganha seu lugar sem obrigar você a cavar o canal inteiro.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-pad section-dark">
    <div class="container">
      <SectionHeading
        eyebrow="EM DESTAQUE"
        title={`LIVE ${String(featuredLive.number).padStart(2, '0')}: ${featuredLive.title}`}
        text={featuredLive.description}
      />

      <article class="live-ticket live-ticket-featured">
        <span class="ticket-kicker">{featuredLive.kicker}</span>
        <h3>{featuredLive.title}</h3>
        <p>{featuredLive.description}</p>
        <div class="tag-row">
          {featuredLive.tags.map((tag) => <span>{tag}</span>)}
        </div>
        {featuredLive.youtubeUrl ? (
          <a class="button button-primary" href={featuredLive.youtubeUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Abrir no YouTube</a>
        ) : (
          <p class="availability-note">O link oficial entra aqui quando estiver cadastrado.</p>
        )}
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-pad">
    <div class="container empty-panel">
      <strong>O arquivo histórico está sendo organizado.</strong>
      <p>Não vamos preencher a página com títulos aproximados ou links incertos. As rodadas anteriores entram conforme o catálogo oficial for cadastrado.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
